        <profileDesc>
            <creation/>
            <abstract>
                <p>This is a general record for any Gǝʿǝz texts that contain the teachings of the Orthodox Church about the five main tenets of belief: 
                    belief in the Holy Trinity, the Incarnation, the baptism, the Eucharist, and the resurrection of the dead. 
                    The text is typically structured in the form of questions (inquiries) and answers (explanations).</p>
            </abstract>
